Third-party content
-------------------

The following content in this pack comes from third parties under their own
terms.

Data (system-solar/data/)

Facts from NASA/JPL Horizons and the JPL planetary satellite mean elements
(NASA/JPL-Caltech, public domain) and the IAU WGCCRE rotational elements
(Archinal et al. 2018).

Skybox (system-solar/resources/textures/skyboxes/)

Deep Star Maps 2020, NASA/GSFC Scientific Visualization Studio
(https://svs.gsfc.nasa.gov/4851), from ESA's Gaia DR2, Hipparcos-2 and Tycho-2
catalogues. NASA media usage guidelines.

Moon surface (system-solar/resources/textures/bodies/luna/, system-solar/data/terrains/luna.ktx2)

NASA Lunar Reconnaissance Orbiter LROC and LOLA data, NASA/GSFC/Arizona State
University; elevation through NASA's Scientific Visualization Studio CGI Moon
Kit. Public domain.
